  "motion": {
    "frames": 120,
    "note": "Heavy armoured chestnut sumo braced in guard (base Chesnaught's stance: feet wide and planted, knees bent and out, body low, arms spread with fists raised, the Mega shields swung forward beside the head). It holds its ground: one slow breath per loop is the driver; the body sinks ~1 px into the bent legs and the chest lifts, while a slow weight shift (a quarter loop later) leans the trunk a degree side to side over the planted feet. Head, fists, shields follow a beat later; the light fur cape, face fur and tail trail last and move most.",
